WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.790
The academic rival kissing?

2
00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:04.000
Wait, what? Enemies to lovers is so real?

3
00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:04.800
I fanned myself.

4
00:00:04.840 --> 00:00:06.720
Ah! I'm screaming! I'm screaming!

5
00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:08.490
I rewatched it six times!

6
00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:12.310
Did you see Theo kissing Raymond?

7
00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:15.610
And now the track and field
king is after him, too?

8
00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:18.900
You two geniuses...

9
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.630
...have the whole faculty talking.

10
00:00:33.430 --> 00:00:35.000
Nothing I can do about it.

11
00:00:35.630 --> 00:00:37.130
Besides, they're not wrong.

12
00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:51.450
You hit on the Jakarta guy too?

13
00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:54.990
Can I borrow your prints, Gi?

14
00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:56.670
Up to you, Your Highness!

15
00:00:57.940 --> 00:00:58.750
Can we?

16
00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:03.890
I'm sorry about earlier.

17
00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:05.670
I was just teasing you.

18
00:01:07.210 --> 00:01:08.110
It's okay.
